{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4a963463-1202-8089-9ccb-b3d722691f07",
  "created_at": "2026-01-02T10:54:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Richard Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:51:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:51:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Trash question."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:51:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:52:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Neighbor dumps bags at the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:52:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Bags of trash just left out on the corner, not at their own house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:52:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Corner. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:52:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And where is that corner? What's the address you're near?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:52:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "218 Memorial Boulevard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:52:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "218 Memorial Boulevard, over by Easton's Beach. Okay. Is it a few bags or a big pile?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:52:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four bags. Maybe five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:52:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Are they sitting there now, or have they been out a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:52:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:52:47-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll put in a note so someone can take a look at that. Anything else about it? Are the bags torn open, any animals getting into them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:53:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Closed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:53:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that helps. Did you want to know anything about the schedule?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:53:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "When's the next pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:53:14-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up your street. [pause] Okay, for Memorial Boulevard your pickup is Monday. With the holiday this week it may have shifted a day, but it's Monday coming up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:53:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:53:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. And if those bags aren't from your house, just leave them be. Don't put them out with yours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:53:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wasn't going to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:53:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Do you want a call back when someone's been out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:53:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:53:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:54:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. I gotta return a carpet cleaner this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:54:06-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I hope it did the job. Okay, so I've got the corner by 218 Memorial, four or five closed bags, and your pickup is Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:54:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:54:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks for calling, Mr. Brownell. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:54:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
